                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "66ad10da-f5ab-3a4c-b3ca-05464f18ceb0",
                        "entry_id": "5ce62dbd-c9ae-3111-974d-7f72682de2e0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "относящийся к йоге"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c34fc41c-3ce8-45be-b804-32eb831521eb",
                                "sense_id": "66ad10da-f5ab-3a4c-b3ca-05464f18ceb0",
                                "text": "Йогическая практика."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ee45d23-b656-44d6-85fb-af597370c629",
                                "sense_id": "66ad10da-f5ab-3a4c-b3ca-05464f18ceb0",
                                "text": "«Девапи и Мару... живущие в месте Калапа, исполненные великой йогической мощи, в конце Калиюги восстановят Варну и Дхарма Ашрам, как ранее»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1daf7dc-3ede-43b8-80e0-5c81b3ab8a39",
                                "sense_id": "66ad10da-f5ab-3a4c-b3ca-05464f18ceb0",
                                "text": "Йогическая наука, хотя далеко не все мои западные коллеги отдают себе в этом отчет, полярна европейской в методе познания."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "00671710-773b-49c8-b9b2-37dbbac6c57d",
                        "source_entry_id": "5ce62dbd-c9ae-3111-974d-7f72682de2e0",
                        "source_sense_id": "66ad10da-f5ab-3a4c-b3ca-05464f18ceb0",
                        "target_lang_word": "yogic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "yogic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a617227d-69df-3b7d-8bf4-e302654d086b",
                                        "entry_id": "27888530-f6f7-39c1-8f96-0c8ba97a7a22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to yoga."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d68d0e3-1758-41b4-bf31-58db7dcea3ac",
                                                "sense_id": "a617227d-69df-3b7d-8bf4-e302654d086b",
                                                "text": "Here we see the yogic pattern, \"Loss of semen equals loss of soul.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09df8bd2-613f-437c-8a7d-eb9ab88168cb",
                                                "sense_id": "a617227d-69df-3b7d-8bf4-e302654d086b",
                                                "text": "She says that rubbing palms or the soles of the feet together is a yogic technique that integrates the left side of the brain and the right."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
